msgid "%d Chars"
msgstr "Herufi %d"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Slowlog Table Names [ optional ]"
msgstr "Majina ya Majedwali ya Slowlog [ hiari ]"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Leave Blank for Auto Detection which runs must faster."
msgstr "Acha Tupu kwa Ugunduzi Kiotomatiki ambao hufanya kazi haraka zaidi."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Cacti Table Detection"
msgstr "Ugunduzi wa Majedwali ya Cacti"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "How to tell Cacti-native tables apart from other tables referenced in the slow query log. Defaults to detecting every table with no grouping."
msgstr "Jinsi ya kutofautisha majedwali asilia ya Cacti na majedwali mengine yaliyorejelewa kwenye kumbukumbu ya hoja za polepole. Chaguo-msingi ni kugundua kila jedwali bila kuyaweka katika makundi."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Detect all tables (no 'OTHER TABLES' grouping)"
msgstr "Gundua majedwali yote (hakuna kundi la 'MAJEDWALI MENGINE')"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Use this Cacti Database; group other tables as 'OTHER TABLES'"
msgstr "Tumia Hifadhidata hii ya Cacti; weka majedwali mengine kama 'MAJEDWALI MENGINE'"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Detect all tables; group tables not in the list below as 'OTHER TABLES'"
msgstr "Gundua majedwali yote; weka majedwali ambayo hayako kwenye orodha hapa chini kama 'MAJEDWALI MENGINE'"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Tables of Interest"
msgstr "Majedwali Yanayolengwa"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Only used by the 'Detect all tables; group ... as OTHER TABLES' option above. Please provide a space delimited list of known tables to compare against. In Linux/UNIX, you may obtain a list of tables by using the following command:<br><br> print `mysql -u<i><b>user</b></i> -p<i><b>password</b></i> -e \"show tables\" <i><b>database</b></i> | grep -v Tables_in` | tr '\\n' ' '<br><br>The values of '<i><b>user</b></i>', '<i><b>password</b></i>', and '<i><b>database</b></i>' are replaced with your values."
msgstr "Hutumiwa tu na chaguo la 'Gundua majedwali yote; weka kundi ... kama MAJEDWALI MENGINE' hapo juu. Tafadhali toa orodha ya majedwali yanayojulikana iliyotenganishwa kwa nafasi ili kulinganisha nayo. Katika Linux/UNIX, unaweza kupata orodha ya majedwali kwa kutumia amri ifuatayo:<br><br> print `mysql -u<i><b>user</b></i> -p<i><b>password</b></i> -e \"show tables\" <i><b>database</b></i> | grep -v Tables_in` | tr '\\n' ' '<br><br>Thamani za '<i><b>user</b></i>', '<i><b>password</b></i>', na '<i><b>database</b></i>' hubadilishwa na thamani zako."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Upload Limits"
msgstr "Vikomo vya Upakiaji"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "File Size upload limits in Cacti."
msgstr "Vikomo vya ukubwa wa faili ya kupakia katika Cacti."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Max Upload Filesize"
msgstr "Ukubwa wa Juu wa Faili ya Kupakia"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "The maximum filesize your Apache server will allow to be uploaded is set to the value on the right.  Currently, you can not upload a file larger than this.  If you have MySQL Slow logs larger than this, you must alter the <i>php.ini</i> file associated with Apache, find the variable <b><i>upload_max_filesize</i></b> and increase the value.  After which you must restart Apache."
msgstr "Ukubwa wa juu zaidi wa faili ambao seva yako ya Apache itaruhusu kupakiwa umewekwa kwa thamani iliyo upande wa kulia. Kwa sasa, huwezi kupakia faili kubwa kuliko hii. Ikiwa una kumbukumbu za polepole za MySQL kubwa kuliko hii, lazima ubadilishe faili ya <i>php.ini</i> inayohusiana na Apache, tafuta kigezo <b><i>upload_max_filesize</i></b> na uongeze thamani yake. Baada ya hapo lazima uanze upya Apache."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Max Post Size"
msgstr "Ukubwa wa Juu wa Post"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "The maximum size you can post to the Apache server is set to the value on the right.  If you have MySQL Slow logs larger than this value, you must alter the <i>php.ini</i> file associated with Apache, find the variable <b><i>post_max_size</i></b> and increase its value.  After which you must restart Apache."
msgstr "Ukubwa wa juu zaidi unaoweza kutuma (post) kwenye seva ya Apache umewekwa kwa thamani iliyo upande wa kulia. Ikiwa una kumbukumbu za polepole za MySQL kubwa kuliko thamani hii, lazima ubadilishe faili ya <i>php.ini</i> inayohusiana na Apache, tafuta kigezo <b><i>post_max_size</i></b> na uongeze thamani yake. Baada ya hapo lazima uanze upya Apache."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Max Execution Time"
msgstr "Muda wa Juu wa Utekelezaji"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "How long (in seconds) this request is allowed to run for; 0 means unlimited. This plugin already raises it to unlimited for its own requests, but a web server or reverse proxy in front of PHP (Apache Timeout, Nginx fastcgi_read_timeout/proxy_read_timeout, PHP-FPM request_terminate_timeout) can still cut the request off independently - that cannot be detected or overridden from here."
msgstr "Muda (kwa sekunde) ambao ombi hili linaruhusiwa kutekelezwa; 0 inamaanisha bila kikomo. Programu-jalizi hii tayari inauinua hadi bila kikomo kwa maombi yake yenyewe, lakini seva ya wavuti au proksi iliyo mbele ya PHP (Apache Timeout, Nginx fastcgi_read_timeout/proxy_read_timeout, PHP-FPM request_terminate_timeout) bado inaweza kukatiza ombi hilo kwa kujitegemea - hilo haliwezi kugunduliwa au kubatilishwa kutoka hapa."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Unlimited"
msgstr "Bila Kikomo"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Memory Limit"
msgstr "Kikomo cha Kumbukumbu"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "How much memory this request is allowed to use; -1 means unlimited. This plugin already raises it to unlimited for its own requests. A very large slow query log being read/imported in a single request can exceed a limited value."
msgstr "Kiasi cha kumbukumbu ambacho ombi hili linaruhusiwa kutumia; -1 inamaanisha bila kikomo. Programu-jalizi hii tayari inakiinua hadi bila kikomo kwa maombi yake yenyewe. Kumbukumbu kubwa sana ya hoja za polepole inayosomwa/kuingizwa katika ombi moja inaweza kuzidi thamani yenye kikomo."

